      "id": "world-forest-v1",
      "name": "Enchanted Gem Forest",
      "artBrief": "Enchanted Gem Forest: intimate ancient crystal woodland, framing rounded copper bark trees draped with teal and jade leaves, late-afternoon sun shafts, vibrant waxcap mushrooms and low clusters of pink and violet crystals at the outer edges; a small crooked footbridge over a brook in the back left and a winding honey-colored path opening into a wide uncluttered, level clearing across the bottom center.",
