        "Treasure chest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "world-workshop-v1",
      "name": "Inventor’s Workshop",
      "artBrief": "Inventor's Workshop: interior of a cheerful eccentric industrial atelier, golden oak beams, softly polished turquoise enamel/brass machinery and coil springs, small colorful gem sorter and inventing workbench on left, porthole high at right with sunlight falling diagonally onto an open honey parquet workshop floor across the bottom center. Brilliant brass joinery, round handwheels, no big front conveyor.",
