    },
    {
      "id": "world-cloud-v1",
      "name": "Cloud Kingdom",
      "artBrief": "Cloud Kingdom: broad, open-air sky, a sweeping curved rainbow and airy pearl pink cumulus clouds, a whimsical turreted citadel on one distant floating island high right, thin waterfalls cascade past the cloud bank on left. A broad grassy sky-island terrace in the lower third, lilac stone edges, clear walking surface at center.",
