    {
      "id": "world-moon-v1",
      "name": "Moon Adventure",
      "artBrief": "Moon Adventure: playful lavender lunar terrain, gently scalloped shallow craters and blue jewel geodes framing the edges, a tiny domed exploratory station on the far left horizon, gigantic warm ringed apricot planet diagonally across the far right sky, tiny stars, turquoise/coral space lighting, bright dusk, broad walkable gently lit moon-dust clearing across the lower middle.",
